&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are on a mission to pioneer the world’s next era of play. As we grow across Europe and Latin America, we’re building The Playstack - the technology powering the next generation of sports, gaming, and fan experiences. Join us, and help make it the most widely used platform in the world! From operations, to marketing, to product, we are looking for talented people who will shape how millions of customers play, watch, and connect every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;_chunkWrapper_1lnon_44&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_animating_1lnon_10&quot; data-newtext-seq=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re seeking an inspiring &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_animating_1lnon_10&quot; data-newtext-seq=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Head of Product Design - Sports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_animating_1lnon_10&quot; data-newtext-seq=&quot;0&quot;&gt; to lead our forward-thinking design team at Super. This strategic role combines vision, hands-on creativity, and leadership to shape the end-to-end customer experience across our sports betting platforms. You will translate company goals and customer needs into compelling design strategies that differentiate our products, foster user engagement, and extend our market reach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
