&lt;li&gt;Lead on customer understanding, discovery and defining customer value for our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI to drive discovery and utilise customer feedback from multiple touchpoints across the organisation to build a picture of customer problems, opportunities and behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make data-driven decisions using customer research, behavioural, product and commercial data, working with AI &amp;amp; Data Analysts to develop the reporting capabilities needed to measure customer behaviour and product engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
